OL,3,GNEWSAWhy are data centres such a big
OL,4,Adeal in Scotland?
OL,5,
OL,6,FEvery time you ask ChatGPT a question,
OL,7,Fread a Google summary or make an online
OL,8,Fbank payment, a data centre is working
OL,9,Fbehind the scenes.
OL,11,FNow Scotland is part of a global race
OL,12,Fto build many more of them - on a
OL,13,Fmassive scale.
OL,15,FThe explosion in artificial
OL,16,Fintelligence (AI) over the past few
OL,17,Fyears has seen tech firms scrambling to
OL,18,Fbuild new "hyperscale" data centres,
OL,19,Fincluding some which would rank among
OL,20,Fthe biggest in the world.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
